# The preview window (tests/t1/museum_editor.sh), on the project of the table session in a folder whose photograph is a real picture.
# A double click opens the table of the first sequence; W opens the preview window, which shows that sequence.
4 move 350 230
5 down
6 up
7 down
8 up
12 key w
# An edit in the editor's window: the photograph is dragged on the table. A moment later the preview window shows the sequence again, changed.
44 move 450 280
45 down
46 move 500 300
47 move 700 380
48 up
# A click in the preview window follows a link there.
94 window 1
94 move 480 515
95 window 1
95 down
96 window 1
96 up
# Undo in the editor: the document changes again, and the preview window comes back to the sequence being edited.
130 key z meta
